// Foundation — the standard library every Kira program may import by name.
//
// This is the module `import Foundation` binds. It ships with the toolchain
// rather than with any project, so a program reaches it without a path and
// without a dependency entry.
//
// It is deliberately small. Foundation's remaining files in the reference
// implementation — Printable, Test, Derive, DeriveSerde, FileSystem, Web —
// each wait on a language subsystem this compiler has not built yet
// (constructs, comptime, macros, FFI). They are named as refusals in
// `docs/foundation.md` rather than stubbed here: a stub that compiles and does
// nothing is worse than an import that says what is missing.

function printLine(text: borrow String) {
    print(text)
    return
}
